* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# The vendored loader is a PE binary. `text=auto` currently leaves it alone
# because git detects it as binary, but a detection that changes its mind would
# rewrite line endings inside an executable. Scoped to the payload rather than
# the directory: `binary` also implies -diff, and the vendored README carries the
# upstream tag, commit and SHA-256 that a loader bump is reviewed on.
vendor/**/*.dll binary
vendor/**/*.exe binary
